{"id":"665409","name":"萝卜煎蛋掉秤汤","author":"独乐乐不如众乐乐","authorId":"1820812","desc":"","cover":"images/665409/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"半根"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白萝卜削皮。","img":"images/665409/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切一半。","img":"images/665409/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用擦丝器擦成丝。","img":"images/665409/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用水洗出涩味。沥干。","img":"images/665409/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煎两个蛋。","img":"images/665409/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒油，放姜丝和萝卜丝中火炒软。","img":"images/665409/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加开水，放煎蛋。","img":"images/665409/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放虾皮。煮6分钟。","img":"images/665409/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"然后放枸杞，白胡椒粉，盐和鸡粉。","img":"images/665409/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}